ilot Memory?**\n- **Source:** [GitHub Enterprise Cloud Docs](https://docs.github.com/en/enterprise-cloud@latest/copilot/concepts/agents/copilot-memory)\n- Copilot Memory can store:\n  - **Repository-level facts**\n  - **User-level preferences**\n- The stored information is used to enhance future work and code assistance\n\n### 5. **Pricing (2025-2026)**\n- **Source:** [UserJot Guide](https://userjot.com/blog/github-copilot-pricing-guide-2025)\n- Copilot Pro: $10/month or $100/year\n- Copilot Pro+: $39/month or $390/year\n\n## Summary\nGitHub Copilot Memory with user-level preferences rolled out in early access starting late 2025 through 2026 for Pro and Pro+ users. However, as of April 2026, new sign-ups for these plans are temporarily paused. The feature allows Copilot to learn and remember user preferences to provide more personalized assistance over time.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
