ous cloud agent timing and hydration edge cases that could degrade reliability\",\n        \"source\": \"Cursor Official Changelog\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Development Environments for Cloud Agents\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor introduced new tools for teams to configure development environments for their agents, including multi-repo environments, environment configuration as code with Dockerfile-based support, improved agent-led environment setup, and governance/security controls with version history and audit logs.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Cursor in Microsoft Teams Integration\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor is now available in Microsoft Teams. Users can mention @Cursor in any Teams channel to delegate tasks to cloud agents or pull information from Cursor. The integration automatically selects the right repository and model based on prompt and recent activity.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"PR Review, Build Plan in Parallel, and Split PRs\",\n    \"description\": \"New PR review experience in Cursor 3 with inline review threads, commits tab, and changes tab. Cursor can now execute plans faster by multitasking across parallel agents, and users can split changes into PRs with built-in quick actions.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"GitHub Copilot App Technical Preview\",\n    \"description\": \"GitHub announced the Copilot app